  ('Computer Science', 'AQA', 'gcse', '3.1', 'Fundamentals of Algorithms', 'How does a bubble sort work?', 'It repeatedly passes through a list, comparing adjacent items and swapping them if they are in the wrong order, until no swaps are needed.', 18),
